{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends will be launched into the first level of Birddawg X for this game's demo version. New levels will be released upon the official drop. The game however operates like the final version. Players will traverse the canyon map (level 1) in search of rings and ammo. The pick-ups are spread across the level and it is your duty to collect 50+ rings in order to unlock the championship ring.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly through the skies and stall out your competitor by shooting them with arrows until their health is depleted.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GoodLuck on the battle field players. All the best.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525660?t=1740511770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740511770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525660/fa7c551f4abfda4af24e16bc3cf3006770ca3671/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740511770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525660/fa7c551f4abfda4af24e16bc3cf3006770ca3671/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740511770","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends will be launched into the first level of Birddawg X for this game's demo version. New levels will be released upon the official drop. The game however operates like the final version. Players will traverse the canyon map (level 1) in search of rings and ammo. The pick-ups are spread across the level and it is your duty to collect 50+ rings in order to unlock the championship ring.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly through the skies and stall out your competitor by shooting them with arrows until their health is depleted.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GoodLuck on the battle field players. All the best.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Joshua Woods"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3491190","name":"Birddawg X"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525660/header.jpg?t=1740511770","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257097700,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097700/movie480.mp4?t=1740511768","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097700/movie_max.mp4?t=1740511768"},"name":"Birddawg X - Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257097700/5160192bad829a1793d459c56ac00b51c61c5cc5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740511768","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097700/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740511768","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097700/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740511768"}}],"name":"Birddawg X Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inte